{"id":"okhotno","lemma":"охотно","pos":"adv","rank":4621,"glosses":["with pleasure, willingly, readily, gladly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я охотно это сделаю.","en":"I will do it gladly.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Он охотно помог мне.","en":"He's helped me willingly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Том ответил, что он охотно пойдёт.","en":"Tom replied that he'd be glad to go.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to answer, to reply","l":"ответить"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Он охотно согласился на это.","en":"He readily agreed to it.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to agree","l":"согласиться"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Он довольно охотно одолжил мне деньги.","en":"He lent me the money quite willingly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"enough, sufficient"},null,{"g":"to lend","l":"одолжить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"money"}]}]}